  m_text: "\n \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ANOMAL\xCDA PREDICTIVA: VIABILIDAD OPERATIVA COMPROMETIDA\_
    \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \n\t\_ Retorno estimado: 15.5% (\xB13.2% tolerancia
    t\xE9rmica)\_ |\_ L\xEDmite seguro: 20.0%\_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \n\n\t MATRIZ DE TRADE-OFF
    GERENCIAL (DECISI\xD3N SUPERVISOR - INDUSTRIA 5.0):\_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_
    \n\_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_
    \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \n\t\u2022 [OPCI\xD3N
    A: FORZAR OVERRIDE]\_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_
    \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_\n\_ \_ Consumo motor: +30% | Aceleraci\xF3n: -50%
    | Degradaci\xF3n t\xE9rmica de celda: ALTA.\_ \_ \_ \_\_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_
    \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_
    \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \n \n\t\u2022 [OPCI\xD3N B: ACTIVAR RELEVO 24/7]\_
    \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_ \_\n
    \_ Retirar AMR-01 a carga inductiva. Desplegar AMR-02 (80%) para asumir el pedido.\_
    \n   Aceleraci\xF3n: -50% | Degradaci\xF3n t\xE9rmica de celda: ALTA. \n                                                                                       
    \n    \n"
